        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Four-Bedroom Semi-Detached Home\nLocated at the top of Teeling Street, Station View is a renovation project with plenty of potential to become a fine town-centre family home.\n\nThe accommodation is well proportioned throughout and includes a spacious sitting room, a traditional kitchen, four bedrooms and a family bathroom. Several rooms retain traditional fireplaces and other period details.\n\nWhile the property requires refurbishment and upgrading, its layout and room sizes provide plenty of scope to create an attractive family home. The bedrooms offer flexibility for family living, guest accommodation, a home office or hobby space. Having been vacant for approximately five years, the property may qualify for a range of improvement grants, subject to the relevant terms, conditions and approval.\n\nOutside, the house benefits from a front garden, along with side and rear access to the yard and sheds at the back of the property. These outdoor areas could be improved to provide additional storage or workspace.\n\nThis is an ideal opportunity for a purchaser who is prepared to undertake a renovation and bring new life to a traditional home. With the right improvements, the property has the potential to become a comfortable modern residence with lasting appeal.\n\nLocation\n\nOnly 400 m from Tubbercurry town centre and opposite Tubbercurry Garda Station. The property is within walking distance of grocery shops, sports facilities, the health centre and other local amenities.\n\nAccommodation\n\nDownstairs\n\nEntrance hall\nSitting room 3.7 m x 4.7 m\nKitchen 4 m x 3.5 m\nBedroom 4 (1.5 m x 3.1 m) + (1 m x 4.8 m)\nRear porch 2 m x 1 m\n\nUpstairs\n\nLanding\nPrimary bedroom 3.3 m x 4.7 m\nBedroom 2 2.6 m x 3.5 m\nBedroom 3 (3 m x 3 m) + (0.8 m x 1.7 m)\nBathroom 2.1 m x 1.9 m w/ bath, WHB and WC\n\nOutside\n\nShed 1 1.7 m x 4.4 m\nShed 2 1.8 m x 2.1 m\nOuthouse 1.4 m x 0.8 m\nSide and rear access\n\nServices\n\nMains water\nMains sewerage\nStorage heaters\nElectricity\n\nThis is a property that should not be overlooked.\n\nContact REA McCarrick for further details or to arrange a viewing.\n\ninfo@reamccarrick.ie\n+353 71 918 5050\n\n"
      },
      {
